    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho kare tsi ya Iziraeli iriphokala inalongozwa ni aamuli, kpwahenda ndzala kali kahi za tsi hiyo. Phahi mutu mmwenga kula mudzi wa Bethilehemu hiko Juda, wauka iye, mchewe na anae airi alume achendasagala kpwa muda tsi ya Moabu kuchimbira iyo ndzala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu hiyu kala anaihwa Elimeleki na mchewe kala anaihwa Naomi. Ana ao, mmwenga kala anaihwa Maloni na wa phiri kala anaihwa Kilioni. Phahi Elimeleki na atu a nyumbaye kala ala mryango wa Efuratha hiko Bethilehemu ya Juda. Atu hinya aphiya Moabu achendasagala hiko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi ariphokala a hiko Moabu, Elimeleki, mlume wa Naomi wafwa na Naomi achirichwa macheye na anae airi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambi uriphofika wakati wa hinyo avulana kulóla achetu, alóla achetu a Chimoabu. Mkpwaza Maloni kala anaihwa Ruthi na mkpwaza Kilioni yekala anaihwa Oripa. Nao akala hiko Moabu kpwa muda wa kama miaka kumi hivi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badaye Maloni na Kilioni nao achifwa na Naomi achirichwa gungu bila mlume wala ana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambi Naomi ariphokala a hiko Moabu, wasikira kukala Mwenyezi Mlungu waapha atue chakurya hiko Juda, kpwa hivyo iye na akaza anae achifunga charo kuphiya Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.6+RUT.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.6",
              "RUT.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela himo njirani, Naomi waambira hara akaza anae, “Uyani kpwenu mrikovyalwa anangu. Mwenyezi Mlungu naakuhendereni manono dza murivyonihendera mimi na hinyo alume enu ariphokala achere moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu naakupheni alume anjina mlólwe na mphahe midzi mndiyosagala.” Chisha Naomi achiadonera na achialaga. Ela nyo achiandza kurira sana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na achimuamba, “Hata, tahundakuricha bii, hundaphiya nawe ko kpwa atu enu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naomi achiamba, “Ni baha mkaphiya vyenu, mana pho ninaweza kukuvyarirani tsona alume a kukulólani mino anangu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyani kpwenu mana mimi ni mvyere sana siweza kulólwa tsona. Hata kala ningeweza kulólwa usiku uhu na kuvyala ana alume, mngeweza kuagodza hadi akale avyere? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dze, mngeweza kudzizuwiya msilólwe ni atu anjina? Kpwa kpweli taviwezekana kpwa sababu Mwenyezi Mlungu akanitsupha, kpwa hivyo anangu nina utsungu kuriko mwimwi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphosikira hivyo achirira tsona. Ariphonyamala, Oripa achimdonera nine-vyala, achimlaga na achiuya kpwao arikovyalwa, ela Ruthi ye kayamricha nine-vyala bii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Naomi achimuambira Ruthi, “Wawayo akauya kpwao na kpwa milungu ya kpwao. Phiya nawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Ruthi achimjibu achiamba, “Usinisisitize nikuriche wala kunikahaze kukulunga-lunga. Nahuphiye hosi hiko uphiyako; hiko undikophiya nami nndaphiya; phophosi undipholala nami ni ndalala phapho. Atuo andakala atu angu na Mlunguo andakala Mlungu wangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho undiphofwa nami nindafwa phapho na nindazikpwa phapho. Mwenyezi Mlungu na anihale ichikala kundakala na chitu chochosi cha kunihenda nitengane nawe isiphokala chifo macheye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naomi ariphoona Ruthi akadinda, kayamlunga nago tsona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi achiphiya hadi achifika Bethilehemu. Ariphofika hiko, chidzidzi chosi atu akala gomogomo. Achetu anji a Bethilehemu ariphomuona Naomi achimaka sana na achiuzana, “Ni Naomi kpweli yuno?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiamba, “Msiniihe Naomi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Chieburania",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Naomi",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "manage ni",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mtswano",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "au",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "chinachohamira.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " niihani Mara,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Chieburania",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mara",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ni",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "utsungu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mana Mwenye Nguvu Zosi akahenda maisha gangu gakale utsungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nauka tele, ela vino Mwenyezi Mlungu akaniuyiza chihuphu. Phahi kpwa utu wani mniihe Naomi (yani mwenye raha) na kuno Mwenyezi Mlungu akanigayisa, Iye Mwenye Nguvu Zosi akanibwagira mashaka?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivi ndivyo Naomi arivyouya kula Moabu na yuya mkpwaza-mwanawe wa Chimoabu yeihwa Ruthi. Afika Bethilehemu mwandzo wa mavuno ga shayiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
